+Badges also flag references that no longer match a node. A missing gate or visit count is an error and blocks publishing. A direct presence check of that one reference is a warning instead: `$exists(gates."old-id")` in JSONata, or `{% if gates["old-id"] %}` in Liquid with nothing else in the condition. Inside a longer condition, a comparison or a filter, the reference counts as an ordinary read. An output key whose origin is unknown and a computed key are warnings.
 
